Phase 3 – Job Management
    Step 3.1 – Job Status System ✅
        Add a Status button to each job in the list.
        Add the same Status option inside the Job Details modal.
        Available actions: Apply / Save / Hide
    Step 3.2 – Personal Job Status ✅
        Store user actions in the my_jobs table.
        Do not modify jobs or job_analysis.
    Step 3.3 – Hide Jobs ✅
        When a job is marked Hidden:
        Save status as HIDDEN in my_jobs.
        Remove it from Decision Intelligence.
        Never show it again unless hidden jobs are explicitly viewed.
    Step 3.4 – Apply Jobs ✅
        When a job is marked Applied:
        Save status as APPLIED in my_jobs.
        Remove it from Decision Intelligence.
        Automatically display it in the Applications page.
    Step 3.5 – Save Jobs ✅
        When a job is marked Saved:
        Save status as SAVED in my_jobs.
        Remove it from the default Decision Intelligence view.
        Display it in the Saved Jobs section (future phase).
    Step 3.6 – Update Dashboard Logic ✅
        Decision Intelligence should display only jobs that:
        AI Recommendation = Apply or Consider
        Have no personal status (NEW)
        Jobs with status:
        HIDDEN
        APPLIED
        SAVED
        should no longer appear in the main recommendation list.
